        {
          "id": 1798585241,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "I'm not familiar with the protocol, but it looks like the intent was not to send the packet to the tap if it was in an error cause. Probably there should be another way to do that (some protocols set `pinfo->flags.in_error_pkt` for similar.)",
